---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "@/config/site";

const updated = "August 2, 2026";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use"
  description="Review the terms that apply when accessing and using Toolsiva online tools."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:py-16">
    <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-brand-300">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-zinc-500">Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <div class="prose-premium mt-8 space-y-8 text-sm leading-7 text-zinc-300">
      <section>
        <h2>1. Acceptance</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing Toolsiva, you agree to these Terms of Use. If you do not agree, do not use
          the service.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>2. Permitted use</h2>
        <p>
          You may use Toolsiva for lawful personal, educational and commercial tasks. You are
          responsible for the information you enter, the results you use and compliance with
          applicable law.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>3. Prohibited conduct</h2>
        <p>
          You must not misuse the service, interfere with availability, attempt unauthorized
          access, distribute malicious code, scrape the site excessively, evade security
          controls or use the tools to violate another person's rights.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>4. Tool results</h2>
        <p>
          Results are generated from the values you provide and may contain errors caused by
          invalid input, browser limitations, rounding, implementation defects or changing
          standards. Verify important results independently.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>5. No professional advice</h2>
        <p>
          Toolsiva does not provide legal, financial, medical, tax, security or other professional
          advice. Calculators and utilities are supplied for general informational purposes.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>6. Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>
          The Toolsiva name, website design, original text, software and branding are protected
          by applicable intellectual-property laws. These terms do not transfer ownership of
          Toolsiva materials.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>7. Availability and changes</h2>
        <p>
          We may update, suspend or remove tools without notice. We do not guarantee uninterrupted
          access, permanent storage, compatibility with every browser or continued availability
          of any specific feature.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>8. Disclaimer of warranties</h2>
        <p>
          The service is provided on an “as is” and “as available” basis, to the extent permitted
          by law, without warranties of accuracy, fitness for a particular purpose or
          non-infringement.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>9. Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the maximum extent permitted by law, Toolsiva will not be liable for indirect,
          incidental, special, consequential or punitive damages arising from use of the service.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>10. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about these terms may be sent to
          <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.contactEmail}`}>{siteConfig.contactEmail}</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
